# Trained model artifacts — only the SMALL runtime artifacts are committed so
# that Render (deploys from Git) can serve /api/predict.
#
#   xgb.joblib, et.joblib, rf.joblib  ~3.5MB / ~390MB / ~172MB
#   et.joblib and rf.joblib exceed GitHub's 100MB per-file limit and are
#   deliberately NOT tracked — serve them from a Render disk/blob instead.
#
# Runtime-required artifacts (committed): model_meta.json, preprocessor.joblib,
# gb.joblib (best + ensemble), lgbm.joblib (ensemble). All other artifacts are
# training-only.
models/
*.joblib
!artifacts/preprocessor.joblib
!artifacts/gb.joblib
!artifacts/lgbm.joblib

# Real training data (large) — do not commit
data/real/train_delays.csv
__pycache__/
*.pyc